From 83014e36dcc3d77de0fc43f11daff96779c3ccbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emergent E1 <e1@emergent.local>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 13:02:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(functions): server-authoritative Cloud Functions
 (v2, modular)

- config.js: central business rules (packs, plans, coin rates, call costs,
  withdrawal minimums, admin roles/action map, feature flags)
- util.js: auth/admin guards, account-state enforcement, audit log,
  canonical walletHistory ledger writes
- payments.js: createStripePaymentIntent (topup+subscription), stripeWebhook
  with signature verification + idempotency (only place that credits Silver /
  activates a plan); confirmStripeTopupDev now gated behind ALLOW_DEV flag
- wallet.js: convertCoins (atomic, region rates, cooldown, whole-coin, streak clamp)
- calls.js: generateAgoraToken (disabled until secrets set), startCall, endCall
  (server computes charge + receiver reward, idempotent)
- withdrawals.js: requestWithdrawal (Love+verified, min-balance, diamond lock,
  state machine) + adminReviewWithdrawal (finance role, returns funds on reject)
- admin.js: adminSetAccountState (freeze/ban/force-logout/liveness/wallet + audit),
  setAdminRole (super_admin), onReportCreated (auto 24h freeze at 3 reports)
- Fix field drift: silverBalance (not silverCoins); walletHistory (not walletTransactions)
- Add agora-token dependency
